{"a":[78,78],"h":"<p>Bunu müteakıb 77.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"170\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 170.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 32.3 32.3 40.4 47.3 63.0 70.4 79.4 86.3 86.3 93.7 100.4 107.3 124.4 131.3 131.3 140.3 147.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"47.3 63.0 70.4 79.4 100.4 107.3 131.3 140.3 147.0 153.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> vakta ki Kameri doğarken gördü, aynı ma'nâ ile<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"126\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 125.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.7 27.7 27.7 27.7 34.4 51.7 58.4 67.4 67.4 85.4 96.0 102.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.4 58.4 85.4 102.7 109.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu benim rabbım ha!... dedi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 49.6 49.6 56.3 56.3 65.3 72.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 27.0 33.7 49.6 65.3 72.0 78.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu da üful edince hem rabbına olan iykanına izhar ederek «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"66\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 65.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.3 14.3 21.0 38.3 45.0 54.0 54.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.0 45.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » sözlerinin iltizamî olmayıb ilzamî ve inkârî olduğunu anlatmak, hem de her lâhza rabbına olan ıhtıyacını i'tiraf ile hidayetine şükr etmek için <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 56.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20