0.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 47.2 63.0 63.0 89.2 115.4 122.2 146.2 155.2 162.0 168.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> vakta ki Güneşi doğarken gördü. -Ve üzerindeki zulmetileyl temamen açılıb subhi nehara irdi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"201\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 200.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 24.0 30.8 30.8 42.0 57.8 64.6 64.6 73.6 73.6 91.6 102.8 102.8 102.8 109.6 126.8 133.6 142.6 142.6 160.6 171.0 177.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"24.0 42.0 64.6 109.6 133.6 160.6 177.8 184.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bu benim rabbım ha!... Bu hepsinden büyük!... dedi.- Ve daha büyük bir târîz yaptı <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"108\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 107.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.7 46.6 62.3 62.3 69.0 69.0 78.0 84.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.0 39.7 46.6 62.3 78.0 84.7 91.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sonra bu da üful edince <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"284\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 284.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 46.6 46.6 54.0 54.0 66.0 66.0 81.7 88.6 88.6 97.6 97.6 113.3 113.3 120.0 133.6 133.6 133.6 141.0 156.7 168.0 168.0 168.0 174.7 174.7 190.6 190.6 197.3 197.3 205.6 221.3 228.0 243.7 254.3 261.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 88.6 141.0 205.6 228.0 243.7 261.0 267.7\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her halde ben sizin rabbıma şerik koştuğunuz şeylerden beriyim 79. </p>"}